<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Order Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Thank you for your order, {{user.name}}!</h1>
  <p>Your order has been successfully paid and is now being processed.</p>
  <p>Order Details:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Order ID: {{order.id}}</li>
    <li>Order Date: {{order.createdAt}}</li>
    <li>Total Price: {{order.totalPrice}}</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
  <p>Best regards,</p>
  <p>The Team</p>
</body>
</html>
